msgstr ""

#: src/Privacy/PolicyContent.php:72
msgid "If your browser sends a Global Privacy Control signal, we honour it: you are not counted beyond the anonymous statistics, and nothing on this site can override that."
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: months of retention.
#: src/Privacy/PolicyContent.php:77
#, php-format
msgid "The statistics we keep are counts - how many people saw a page, which country they were in, what kind of device they used. They are kept for %d month and then deleted."
